```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Graph as SmartScraperGraph
    participant AbstractG as AbstractGraph
    participant BaseG as BaseGraph
    participant Fetch as FetchNode
    participant Browser as Playwright
    participant Parse as ParseNode
    participant Gen as GenerateAnswerNode
    participant LLM as LangChain/LLM
    participant Callback as CallbackManager

    Note over User,Callback: Initialization Phase
    User->>Graph: SmartScraperGraph(prompt, source, config)
    Graph->>AbstractG: __init__(prompt, source, config)
    AbstractG->>AbstractG: _create_llm(config["llm"])
    AbstractG-->>LLM: Create LLM instance (OpenAI/Ollama/etc)
    AbstractG->>Graph: _create_graph()
    Graph->>BaseG: BaseGraph(nodes=[Fetch,Parse,Gen], edges=[(Fetch,Parse),(Parse,Gen)])
    BaseG-->>Graph: Graph instance
    Graph-->>User: Graph ready

    Note over User,Callback: Execution Phase
    User->>Graph: run()
    Graph->>BaseG: execute({user_prompt, url})
    BaseG->>BaseG: _execute_standard(initial_state)

    Note over BaseG,Callback: State: {user_prompt, url}

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over BaseG,Browser: Node 1: FetchNode
        BaseG->>Fetch: execute(state)
        Fetch->>Browser: ChromiumLoader.load(url)
        Browser-->>Fetch: [Document(page_content="<html>...")]
        Fetch->>Fetch: Update state["doc"] = documents
        Fetch-->>BaseG: state
        Note over BaseG: State: {user_prompt, url, doc: [Document]}
    end

    rect rgb(245, 230, 255)
        Note over BaseG,Parse: Node 2: ParseNode
        BaseG->>Parse: execute(state)
        Parse->>Parse: cleanup_html(state["doc"])
        Parse->>Parse: split_text_in_chunks(cleaned_text)
        Parse->>Parse: Update state["parsed_doc"] = chunks
        Parse-->>BaseG: state
        Note over BaseG: State: {user_prompt, url, doc, parsed_doc: "chunked text"}
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over BaseG,Callback: Node 3: GenerateAnswerNode
        BaseG->>Gen: execute(state)
        Gen->>Gen: Build prompt with user_prompt + parsed_doc
        Gen->>Callback: Create callback handler
        Callback-->>Gen: CustomCallbackHandler

        Gen->>LLM: chain.invoke({"question": prompt, "context": chunks})
        activate LLM
        Note over LLM: Processing with GPT-4/Claude/etc
        LLM-->>Gen: {result: {...}}
        deactivate LLM

        Gen->>Callback: Track tokens used
        Callback->>Callback: Calculate cost

        Gen->>Gen: Parse JSON response
        Gen->>Gen: Update state["answer"] = result
        Gen-->>BaseG: state
        Note over BaseG: State: {user_prompt, url, doc, parsed_doc, answer: {...}}
    end

    BaseG->>BaseG: Collect execution_info
    Note over BaseG: execution_info = [{node: "Fetch", time: 1.2s},<br/>{node: "Parse", time: 0.1s},<br/>{node: "Generate", tokens: 1500, cost: $0.02}]

    BaseG-->>Graph: (state, execution_info)
    Graph->>Graph: Extract state["answer"]
    Graph-->>User: answer

    Note over User: User receives extracted data
```
